    "lookFor": "Press play. Both rams hit at about 0.1 s. The bare tank (top) takes about 150 J and is destroyed: it bursts into dust that drifts off and fades, its oxygen with it. The armour (bottom) takes about 200 J, over its 100 J threshold, so it loses 2.5%, and the tank behind it is untouched. Lower the ram speed below about 9 m/s and the bare tank survives, damaged; below about 7 m/s the armour isn't marked at all. Damaged but whole, it leaks its oxygen out of the dent as a jet that pushes it along.",
